          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Deploy Countermeasures"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nRequirements: Yoh is piloting the Solar Jian II\n\nFrequency: 1/hour\n\nWhile the _Solar Jian II_ is not a combat vessel, it does have a magically renewing supply of fireworks for victory parades and the like. Yoh fires them at a 20-foot burst within 60 feet. Creatures in the area take 3d6 fire damage and 3d6 sonic damage with a Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage and is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage and is dazzled for 3 rounds.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double damage, takes 3d4 persistent fire damage, and is dazzled for 1 minute."
            },
